<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>When God made the fish, He said and it was so.</l><l>When God made the birds, He said and it was so.</l><l>But when it came to making man,</l><l>He formed him with His hands,</l><l>For I am fearfully and wonderfully made!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
